<title>GERMANY: Germany's Pro7 broadens underwriting group.</title>
<headline>Germany's Pro7 broadens underwriting group.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>German television broadcaster Pro Sieben Television AG has broadened the underwriting group for its planned share offer, the weekly news magazine Der Spiegel reported.</p>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank, Morgan Grenfell and Bankgesellschaft Berlin have joined the group just a few weeks ahead of the planned public offering, the magazine said in advance of its Monday edition.</p>
<p>The group, led by BHF Bank, Bayerische Hypo and Salomon Brothers, now includes 10 members.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
